A '''species''' of [[Color|white]]-skinned [[Species|beings]] counted among its members [[Grayla Stindy]], an individual who once attended the [[Canto Casino and Racetrack]] on the [[planet]] [[Cantonica]].<ref name="TLJ Companion" /> Members of the species sported large skin flaps that arced down from their bulbous heads.<ref name="Kenobi Part I" />

==Grayla Stindy's species in the galaxy==
One member of the species was a [[Politics|dignitary]] who attended a party held by the [[House of Organa]] on [[Alderaan]] in [[9 BBY]].<ref name="Kenobi date">{{KenobiDate|I}}</ref> There, the [[alien]]'s words were translated for others by the [[protocol droid]] [[C-3PO]].<ref name="Kenobi Part I" />

Around [[9 ABY]],<ref name="The Mandalorian date">{{MandoDate|21}}</ref> at least two members of the species could be seen on [[Nevarro]],<ref name="The Pirate">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 21: The Pirate}}</ref> where one of them played an [[music|instrument]] in a [[band]] on the streets of [[Nevarro City]].<ref name="The Apostate">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 17: The Apostate}}</ref> Around the same time,<ref name="Ahsoka Date">{{AhsokaSeriesDate}}</ref> an alien of this species served as a [[New Republic soldier]], and was present for the arrival of [[Ezra Bridger]] on ''[[Home One]]''.<ref name="Ahsoka Part Eight" /> Another member of the species was employed at the [[Skull Ridge Mountain Hotel & Spa]] on the planet [[Lanupa]] and bestowed a floral necklace on the [[pirate]] patron [[Jod Na Nawood]] during this time period.<ref name="Lot to Learn">{{SkeletonCrew|You Have a Lot to Learn About Pirates}}</ref>

[[Grayla Stindy]] was a member of this species who spent time in the [[city]] of [[Canto Bight]] on [[Cantonica]],<ref name="Movie Companion">[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi The Official Movie Companion|''Star Wars: The Last Jedi'' The Official Movie Companion]]</ref> around the [[Standard year|year]] [[34 ABY]].<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]'' dates the events of [[Star Wars: Episode VII The Force Awakens|''Star Wars'': Episode VII ''The Force Awakens'']] to [[34 ABY]]. As [[Star Wars: Episode VIII The Last Jedi|''Star Wars'': Episode VIII ''The Last Jedi'']] takes place immediately after the events of ''The Force Awakens'', it must also take place in approximately 34 [['ABY-BBY' dating system|ABY]]. ''[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi The Official Movie Companion]]'' depicts events during the film, meaning Stindy's appearance in the magazine takes place in around 34 ABY.</ref>
